Testing epc calculations on H2 with analytic vs finite-difference derivatives.
Assumes no electronic degeneracy and Gamma-only k grids & q grids.
Sections:
1) Analytic dV/dR using eigenvectors from this script
2) One-sided finite difference via ham.calcCouplings_diag_fd()
3) calcCouplings() magnitude output

All settings: 
	Using separateKptGrad. This can decrease the peak memory load during the fitting code.
	Not doing multiprocessing.


